<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines allows peso to move in &quot;wider&quot; range.</title>
<headline>Philippines allows peso to move in &quot;wider&quot; range.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines Central Bank said on Friday that it would allow the peso to move in a wider range against the dollar.</p>
<p>&quot;Starting today....(the central bank will allow the peso-U.S. dollar rate to move within a new wider range consistent with significantly changed market conditions,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
